name asciilist
category Package
revision 49060
shortdesc Environments AsciiList and AsciiDocList for prototyping nested lists in LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc The asciilist provides the environments AsciiList and
longdesc AsciiDocList, which enable quickly typesetting nested lists in
longdesc LaTeX without having to type individual item macros or
longdesc opening/closing list environments. The package provides
longdesc auxiliary functionality for loading such lists from files and
longdesc provides macros for configuring the use of the list
longdesc environments and the appearance of the typeset results.
runfiles size=3
